WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.750
So, the decisions, with their owners.

2
00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:07.461
The executive sponsor charters the
program as governance reconstruction,

3
00:00:07.461 --> 00:00:11.125
signs the charter, and puts names
in it as Phase 0's entry work.

4
00:00:11.125 --> 00:00:14.285
The sponsor and CIO fund
one sequenced program,

5
00:00:14.285 --> 00:00:18.094
with the AD DS retirement
phase and the people beyond the

6
00:00:18.094 --> 00:00:22.875
five-and-a-half-person core in the
budget, approved before design begins.

7
00:00:22.875 --> 00:00:26.639
And they build the steward and
steering committee from the zero

8
00:00:26.639 --> 00:00:30.475
trust lead and the ICAM governance
body the agency already has.

9
00:00:30.475 --> 00:00:34.002
The CISO's office confirms
the M-26-14 dates,

10
00:00:34.002 --> 00:00:40.175
starting with the Agency Logging Plan,
due November 18 by the program's count.

11
00:00:40.175 --> 00:00:45.478
The authorizing official decides whether
anything runs past end of support,

12
00:00:45.478 --> 00:00:48.875
beginning with Windows
Server 2016 on January 12.

13
00:00:48.875 --> 00:00:54.125
The steward sets the evidence and provenance
expectations before the first change,

14
00:00:54.125 --> 00:00:57.050
and clears G0 only when
every Critical finding

15
00:00:57.050 --> 00:01:00.200
is closed or accepted by
the authorizing official.

16
00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:02.935
The steward and sponsor record the pilot's

17
00:01:02.935 --> 00:01:06.138
thresholds before it opens,
and sign G2 on the data.

18
00:01:06.138 --> 00:01:10.891
The sponsor and CIO decide when each
Active Directory component retires,

19
00:01:10.891 --> 00:01:13.463
after the records officer is consulted.

20
00:01:13.463 --> 00:01:18.125
And the steward records the handover to
operations before the project team leaves.

21
00:01:18.125 --> 00:01:19.775
None of these is a purchase.

22
00:01:19.775 --> 00:01:24.884
The case for modernizing now is that the
estate's governance was never written down,

23
00:01:24.884 --> 00:01:29.178
the dates that bind it now belong to
others, and the only way to meet them

24
00:01:29.178 --> 00:01:34.213
without losing that governance is to recover
it deliberately, once, in one program.

25
00:01:34.213 --> 00:01:35.040
Thank you.
